    "title": "Music ringtones for android",
    "description": "Looking to spice up your Android phone's sound experience with some new ringtones? Look no further than Music Ringtones for Android, the wonderful application designed to help you personalize your Android device's ringtones and notification sounds.\r\n\r\nMusic Ringtones for Android features great popular and diverse ringtones songs collection from around the world with 10,000+ ringtones to choose from. And you can easily set any of our music ringtone songs as your default ringtone, message tone, alarm tone, or notification sound.\r\n\r\nEvery single one of these ringtones has been thoughtfully chosen and is loved by millions users: Funny Ringtones, Baby Ringtones, Pop music ringtones, Animals ringtones, R&B songs ringtones, Hiphop, Rap, Rock, Dance, Ringtones remix, Christian & Gospel, Bollywood, Alarm, K-pop, etc.\r\n\r\nIt's so easy for you to quick search and easily choose any of our music ringtone songs as your main ringtone, message alert, alarm tone, or notification sound. With the ability to set different ringtones for different contacts, you can easily recognize who's calling without even looking at your phone.\r\n\r\nYou can also get your matched ringtones from Top Downloads, New Ringtones, or Trending Ringtones.\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Enjoy nice ringtones for Android phones available and let Music Ringtones for Android make your phone sound better from today.\r\n\r\nThank you very much!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking to spice up your Android phone&#39;s sound experience with some new ringtones? Look no further than Music Ringtones for Android, the wonderful application designed to help you personalize your Android device&#39;s ringtones and notification sounds.<br><br>Music Ringtones for Android features great popular and diverse ringtones songs collection from around the world with 10,000+ ringtones to choose from. And you can easily set any of our music ringtone songs as your default ringtone, message tone, alarm tone, or notification sound.<br><br>Every single one of these ringtones has been thoughtfully chosen and is loved by millions users: Funny Ringtones, Baby Ringtones, Pop music ringtones, Animals ringtones, R&amp;B songs ringtones, Hiphop, Rap, Rock, Dance, Ringtones remix, Christian &amp; Gospel, Bollywood, Alarm, K-pop, etc.<br><br>It&#39;s so easy for you to quick search and easily choose any of our music ringtone songs as your main ringtone, message alert, alarm tone, or notification sound. With the ability to set different ringtones for different contacts, you can easily recognize who&#39;s calling without even looking at your phone.<br><br>You can also get your matched ringtones from Top Downloads, New Ringtones, or Trending Ringtones.<br><br>So why wait? Enjoy nice ringtones for Android phones available and let Music Ringtones for Android make your phone sound better from today.<br><br>Thank you very much!",
